.subckt r1_safe_cmp inp inn refp refn out ibias vdda vdd vss
* ibias: 5 uA sunk into the pin (from r1_bgr PTAT branch; ideal source in this step)
XMBN ibias ibias vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=4u l=1u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
XMB2 vbp ibias vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=4u l=1u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
XMBP vbp vbp vdda vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=4u l=2u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
* input pairs, 40 uA tails each
XMTA ta vbp vdda vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=4u l=2u ng=1 m=8 mm_ok=1
XMTB tb vbp vdda vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=4u l=2u ng=1 m=8 mm_ok=1
* each pair is source-degenerated (rhigh per side) so that it stays linear over the full +-1.05 V input range:
* without degeneration both pairs saturate for |Vth| > about 0.1 V and the comparison fails (run safe-cmp-20261020-r1).
XMA1 d1 inp sa1 ta sg13_hv_pmos w=20u l=2u ng=4 m=1 mm_ok=1
XMA2 d2 inn sa2 ta sg13_hv_pmos w=20u l=2u ng=4 m=1 mm_ok=1
XRA1 ta sa1 vss rhigh w=1u l=30u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRA2 ta sa2 vss rhigh w=1u l=30u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XMB1 d1 refn sb1 tb sg13_hv_pmos w=20u l=2u ng=4 m=1 mm_ok=1
XMB2I d2 refp sb2 tb sg13_hv_pmos w=20u l=2u ng=4 m=1 mm_ok=1
XRB1 tb sb1 vss rhigh w=1u l=30u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
XRB2 tb sb2 vss rhigh w=1u l=30u m=1 b=0 mm_ok=1
* NMOS mirror load: d1 diode, d2 output (d2 rises when (inp-inn) > (refp-refn))
XML1 d1 d1 vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=16u l=4u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
XML2 d2 d1 vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=16u l=4u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
* gain stage: NMOS common source, PMOS source 10 uA
XMG o1 d2 vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=2u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
XMGL o1 vbp vdda vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=4u l=2u ng=1 m=2 mm_ok=1
* inverter (3.3 V): o2 high when tripped
XMI1P o2 o1 vdda vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=2u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
XMI1N o2 o1 vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
* hysteresis: a small current steered into d2 while tripped (o1 low) and into d1 otherwise (o2 low);
* steering (not switching off) keeps node hs driven at all times
XMH1a hn1 vbp vdda vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=0.5u l=8u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
XMH1b hn2 vbp hn1 vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=0.5u l=8u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
XMH1c hs vbp hn2 vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=0.5u l=8u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
XMH2 d2 o1 hs vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
XMH3 d1 o2 hs vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
* down-shift to 1.2 V: thick-input inverter on VDD, then thin inverter
XMD1P o3 o2 vdd vdd sg13_hv_pmos w=2u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
XMD1N o3 o2 vss vss sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
XMD2P out o3 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
XMD2N out o3 vss vss sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok=1
.ends r1_safe_cmp

.subckt r1_safe_thr inp inn t0 t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 t11 t12 t13 t14 t15 t16 t17 t18 t19 t20 t21 t22 t23 t24 t25 t26 t27 t28 t29 t30 t31 t32 t33 t34 t35 t36 t37 t38 t39 t40 t41 t42 t43 t44 t45 t46 t47 t48 t49 t50 t51 t52 t53 t54 t55 t56 t57 t58 t59 t60 t61 t62 t63 c0 c1 c2 c3 c4 c5 out ibias vdda vdd vss
* one comparator + its threshold DAC: REFP = T(code), REFN = T(63-code); c0..c5 = 1.2 V code bits
XLS0 c0 vdd vdda vss b0 bb0 r1_safe_ls
XLS1 c1 vdd vdda vss b1 bb1 r1_safe_ls
XLS2 c2 vdd vdda vss b2 bb2 r1_safe_ls
XLS3 c3 vdd vdda vss b3 bb3 r1_safe_ls
XLS4 c4 vdd vdda vss b4 bb4 r1_safe_ls
XLS5 c5 vdd vdda vss b5 bb5 r1_safe_ls
XMXP t0 t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 t11 t12 t13 t14 t15 t16 t17 t18 t19 t20 t21 t22 t23 t24 t25 t26 t27 t28 t29 t30 t31 t32 t33 t34 t35 t36 t37 t38 t39 t40 t41 t42 t43 t44 t45 t46 t47 t48 t49 t50 t51 t52 t53 t54 t55 t56 t57 t58 t59 t60 t61 t62 t63 b0 b1 b2 b3 b4 b5 bb0 bb1 bb2 bb3 bb4 bb5 refp vss r1_safe_mux64
XMXN t0 t1 t2 t3 t4 t5 t6 t7 t8 t9 t10 t11 t12 t13 t14 t15 t16 t17 t18 t19 t20 t21 t22 t23 t24 t25 t26 t27 t28 t29 t30 t31 t32 t33 t34 t35 t36 t37 t38 t39 t40 t41 t42 t43 t44 t45 t46 t47 t48 t49 t50 t51 t52 t53 t54 t55 t56 t57 t58 t59 t60 t61 t62 t63 bb0 bb1 bb2 bb3 bb4 bb5 b0 b1 b2 b3 b4 b5 refn vss r1_safe_mux64
XCMP inp inn refp refn out ibias vdda vdd vss r1_safe_cmp
.ends r1_safe_thr

